		{
			"name": "PostgreSQL — referencia rápida",
			"description": "**Idiomas** (`language.language_name` = query `lang`):\n- `en` → `aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa`\n- `es` → `bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb`\n- `zh` → `cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc`\n\n**Configuraciones** (`configured.config_id`):\n| UUID | Tipo | Valores típicos |\n|------|------|------------------|\n| `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001` | SELECTION | `en`, `es`, `zh` |\n| `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002` | BOOLEAN | `true`, `false` |\n| `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003` | BOOLEAN | `true`, `false` |\n| `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004` | BOOLEAN | `true` = tema oscuro, `false` = tema claro |\n\nConsultas listas: `docker/postgres/reference_queries.sql`",
			"item": []
		},
